        "note": "Perhaps the most reasonable calculation for today’s total Kokama population would be between 20,000 \r\nand 25,000, including people who no longer speak the language... only about 5% (an estimated 1,000 individuals) of the total population speaks the language; the majority have already shifted to Spanish."
