        "note": "There are 2,000 speakers in Peru (W. Adelaar 2000).  Few are monolinguals.  The ethnic population in Peru is 15,000 (W. Adelaar 2000).\r\n\r\n250 in Peru (Crevels 2007). Few monolinguals. Ethnic population: 15,000 (Crevels 2007) (2013)."
